# Recipe Enhancements Implementation Plan

This plan addresses four main feature requests:
1. Adding "rest time" to recipes.
2. Changing preparation, cook, and rest time inputs to an `hh:mm` format.
3. Adjusting video embed dimensions based on platform (YouTube vs TikTok/Instagram) and adding fullscreen support.
4. Moving the "Notes" section above the video section in the recipe details view.
5. Making the "Country of Origin" field a dropdown that allows picking established entries while still allowing new text input.

## User Review Required
> [!IMPORTANT]
> Adding `rest_time_minutes` requires updating the Supabase database schema. This plan will add the field to the TypeScript interfaces and UI, but **you will need to run a migration or manually add the `rest_time_minutes` column (type: integer) to your `recipes` table in Supabase** for it to save properly.

