### UI Components (Create/Edit Recipe)
Update the recipe creation and editing form to handle time inputs in `hh:mm` format, include the new rest time field, and improve the Country of Origin input.

#### [MODIFY] [CreateRecipe.tsx](file:///c:/Users/asnir/Documents/Projects%20Website/1.Zoabi_Kitchen/src/pages/CreateRecipe.tsx)
- **Time Inputs:** Create a new helper component or modify the existing inputs to accept time in `hh:mm` format. 
  - Parse the `hh:mm` string into total minutes before saving.
  - Convert total minutes to `hh:mm` when editing a recipe.
- **Rest Time:** Add the `rest_time` field to the initial state, `formData`, and validation logic.
- **Country of Origin:** Update the `country_origin` input to use a searchable combobox (e.g., using an HTML `<datalist>`). The component will fetch the list of distinct countries from existing recipes to populate the dropdown options, while still allowing manual typing for new entries.

