### UI Components (Recipe Detail)
Update the recipe detail view to show the new rest time, reorder the notes/video sections, and adjust the video aspect ratio.

#### [MODIFY] [RecipeDetail.tsx](file:///c:/Users/asnir/Documents/Projects%20Website/1.Zoabi_Kitchen/src/pages/RecipeDetail.tsx)
- **Time Display:** Update the header/stats section to display `rest_time_minutes` formatted nicely (e.g., `1h 30m`).
